Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.33,0:00:15.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lure it to the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.77,0:00:17.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's how we get the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.73,0:00:20.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, you can't be serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.71,0:00:22.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we do, the boss will\Ngo after the villagers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.01,0:00:23.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's the idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.05,0:00:27.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And while the boss is busy\Nkilling NPCs, we can attack it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.05,0:00:28.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And kill it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.97,0:00:30.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But they're not just objects.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.93,0:00:33.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,NPCs are different than rocks and trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.33,0:00:34.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, they're...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.24,0:00:35.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think they're alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.29,0:00:36.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.55,0:00:39.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In this game, they are just objects.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.09,0:00:43.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And unlike us, if they're\Nkilled, they can always respawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.49,0:00:46.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I'm not cool with that plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.29,0:00:50.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm running this operation, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.75,0:00:55.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In case you forgot, I'm still second in\Ncommand of the Knights of the Blood Oath.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.23,0:00:57.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll obey my orders, like it or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.71,0:01:09.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's with you guys? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.81,0:01:12.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and the second in command.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.67,0:01:15.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're always getting into\Nit, and not in the good way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.29,0:01:17.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess we just don't click, eh, Giel?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.07,0:01:20.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can become powerful here on your own,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.65,0:01:24.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but if the day comes when someone you\Ntrust invites you to join a guild?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.41,0:01:25.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't turn it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.89,0:01:27.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, she took my advice,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.41,0:01:31.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But who knew she'd join the top\Nguild and be a floor-clearing badass?
