Dialogue: 2,0:03:10.98,0:03:14.98,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(525,525)\fsp-1.5\fscx95\fscy85\shad0\pos(994.5,942)\blur0.45\fs72\c&HF5F5F5&}April {\fscx100}11{\fscx95}th, {\fscx110}2024{\fscx95}     {\fscx105}59{\fscx95}th Floor • Danac
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.29,0:03:20.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.87,0:03:28.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.11,0:03:32.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone in the assault team's working\Ntheir butts off to clear the dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.73,0:03:34.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And where do I find you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.27,0:03:35.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out here, taking a nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.17,0:03:38.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if you're a solo player,\Nyou should take this more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.85,0:03:41.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet you didn't know this\Nis Aincrad's nicest season.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.73,0:03:44.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today's weather is at its optimal setting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.11,0:03:44.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.02,0:03:48.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'd be a waste to have to go\Nto work on a day like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.45,0:03:49.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.36,0:03:50.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.55,0:03:52.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you even understand what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.83,0:03:55.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every day here is another\None lost in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.87,0:03:58.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but right now, we're\Nnot in the real world, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.91,0:04:00.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're alive in Aincrad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.29,0:04:05.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.35,0:04:06.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doesn't that breeze feel good?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.97,0:04:08.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.69,0:04:09.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.07,0:04:12.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The weather's always the same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.19,0:04:17.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you laid down on the grass for\Na little bit, you'd understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.85,0:04:59.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, damn, would you look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.21,0:05:02.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Taking a nap in the middle of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.29,0:05:03.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some people sure got it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.75,0:05:05.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Couple of lazy losers, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.23,0:05:09.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe she fell asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.31,0:05:21.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.25,0:05:42.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.67,0:05:44.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You slept like a rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.85,0:05:56.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You get one meal. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.05,0:05:58.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.96,0:06:00.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you can eat, my treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.09,0:06:02.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we'll be even. Deal?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:05.57,0:06:08.53,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(525,0)\fsp-1.5\fscy85\xshad1.5\yshad3\pos(961.5,945)\c&H121212&\4c&H132A3F&\blur3\fs72\alpha&H40\3c&H091E1C&\fscx105}57{\fscx95}th Floor • Marten
Dialogue: 1,0:06:05.57,0:06:08.53,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(525,0)\fsp-1.5\fscy85\xshad1.5\yshad3\pos(961.5,945)\c&H121212&\4c&H0B1A28&\blur3\fs72\alpha&H55\fscx105}57{\fscx95}th Floor • Marten
Dialogue: 2,0:06:05.57,0:06:08.53,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(525,0)\fsp-1.5\fscy85\shad0\pos(960,942)\blur0.45\fs72\c&HF5F5F5&\fscx105}57{\fscx95}th Floor • Marten
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.05,0:06:18.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's asuna from the knights of the\Nblood oath really yeah they call her
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.07,0:06:24.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the lightning flash who's the shady\Nlooking guy dressed in black well anyway
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.71,0:06:29.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thank you for today why for keeping
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.85,0:06:33.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An eye on me, oh sure.\NThe towns are safe areas.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.61,0:06:38.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,supposed to be safe zones and unless\Nyou've agreed to a duel a player can't
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.11,0:06:43.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,attack or kill you but when you're\Nasleep you're vulnerable yeah now
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.99,0:06:47.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we've got player killers who can cheat\Nthe duel system duels are normally
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.05,0:06:52.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,supposed to be tests of strength not\Na fight to the death but even if you
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.27,0:06:56.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,duel in a safe zone your hp is still\Ngoing to go down based on the damage you
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.35,0:06:58.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,take.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.26,0:07:00.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All a sleepy care has\Nto do is manipulate a
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.45,0:07:02.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sleeping player's finger\Nto click the OK button.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.95,0:07:07.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The duel begins like normal, but the\Nsleepy care is doing all the attacking.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.93,0:07:09.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God knows how many
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.63,0:07:12.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,times it's happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.54,0:07:15.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, anyway, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.33,0:07:16.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.07,0:07:18.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you'd do the same for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.39,0:07:40.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry, pull it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.91,0:07:50.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll cut him down, you catch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.79,0:07:51.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.61,0:07:53.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help's on the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.89,0:07:57.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.75,0:08:17.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only way he could have died in a\Nsafe zone is if he was beaten in a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.31,0:08:19.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.27,0:08:22.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, look for the\Nplayer with the winner icon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.11,0:08:25.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no one here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.23,0:08:26.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The room's empty!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.33,0:08:42.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So any idea how this could have happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.79,0:08:44.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, there's always the obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.89,0:08:48.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was a duel and the other guy\Nimpaled the victim with that spear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.69,0:08:52.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then he put a noose around his\Nneck and pushed him out the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.43,0:08:54.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't you say that's about right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.15,0:08:57.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I couldn't see\Nthe winner icon on anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.13,0:08:58.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It had to be a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.53,0:09:00.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a safe zone and a player died.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.95,0:09:03.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A duel's the only thing\Nit could have been.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.23,0:09:09.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.07,0:09:12.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either way, we can't ignore this. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.97,0:09:16.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As it is, a player takes huge\Nrisks going outside a safe zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.43,0:09:18.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if someone's found a way to PK inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.19,0:09:22.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one's going to be safe\Nin the towns either, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.43,0:09:24.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right, I guess we.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.65,0:09:26.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Won't be going back to the\Nfront lines anytime soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.77,0:09:33.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, you're going to work with\Nme until we solve this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.61,0:09:36.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until we do, there won't\Nbe any time for napping.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.69,0:09:39.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay, but you're\Nthe one who is napping!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.03,0:09:53.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.15,0:09:57.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did anyone see what happened\Nbefore that player died?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.09,0:09:58.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If someone did, please speak up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.65,0:10:06.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.57,0:10:08.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can imagine how frightened you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.09,0:10:10.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you tell us your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.73,0:10:12.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.75,0:10:14.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Yoroko.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.63,0:10:15.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.01,0:10:18.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, were you the one who screamed?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.75,0:10:19.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.66,0:10:20.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.91,0:10:25.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His name was Caynz and the two of\Nus used to belong to the same guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.09,0:10:27.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, we came here together today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.93,0:10:30.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were going to have\Ndinner somewhere in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.97,0:10:33.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we got separated in the plaza.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.75,0:10:35.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I looked around for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.59,0:10:39.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I saw him hanging\Nfrom that balcony and...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.51,0:10:43.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was there anyone else up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.95,0:10:46.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For a second there,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.61,0:10:51.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure, but I think I did\Nsee someone standing behind Caynz.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.23,0:10:54.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And this person, had you seen them before?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.37,0:11:02.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, I know this is hard for you,\Nbut think back and try to remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.27,0:11:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could there be someone, anyone\Nwith the reason to kill him?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.23,0:11:21.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for walking me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.29,0:11:22.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry if it's out of your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.03,0:11:23.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.95,0:11:27.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we'd like to talk to you again\Ntomorrow, if you're feeling up to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.77,0:11:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.79,0:11:35.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.05,0:11:36.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.96,0:11:39.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We follow the only solid clue we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.53,0:11:42.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we can find out where\Nthat spear came from,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.11,0:11:44.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it might lead us straight to the killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.47,0:11:47.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll need to find someone\Nwith an appraisal skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.37,0:11:51.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's pretty obvious you\Ndon't have one. No, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.39,0:11:52.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And neither do you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.71,0:11:56.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and by the way, try not to be\Nso rude when you're speaking to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.03,0:11:58.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.75,0:11:59.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should I call you Ms.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.75,0:12:00.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,next time?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.43,0:12:03.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Second in command?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.67,0:12:05.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lightning flash?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.39,0:12:14.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, never mind. Call me Asuna.\NOkay, sure. Back to the appraisal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.23,0:12:18.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Skill, though, do you know anyone\Nwho has it? Hm... I've got a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.79,0:12:22.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who does she's a weapons merchant\Nbut she's really busy these
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.29,0:12:25.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,days so I don't think she'll\Nhave time to help us no worries
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.59,0:12:28.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I happen to know an item merchant\Nwho might be able to help
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.71,0:12:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,us out
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.62,0:12:36.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thanks
Dialogue: 1,0:12:29.66,0:12:32.91,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(525,0)\fsp-1.5\fscy85\xshad1.5\yshad3\pos(961.5,945)\c&H121212&\4c&H02111E&\blur3\fs72\alpha&H40\3c&H091E1C&\fscx110}50{\fscx95}th Floor • Algade
Dialogue: 1,0:12:29.66,0:12:32.91,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(525,0)\fsp-1.5\fscy85\xshad1.5\yshad3\pos(961.5,945)\c&H121212&\4c&H02111E&\blur3\fs72\alpha&H35\fscx110}50{\fscx95}th Floor • Algade
Dialogue: 2,0:12:29.66,0:12:32.91,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(525,0)\fsp-1.5\fscy85\shad0\pos(960,942)\blur0.45\fs72\c&HF5F5F5&\fscx110}50{\fscx95}th Floor • Algade
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.83,0:12:37.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my man come back
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.81,0:12:41.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,anytime yeah whatever looks
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.51,0:12:43.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like you're still running all\Nthe suckers down with those hard
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.89,0:12:49.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,deals of yours no way kirito\Nbuy cheap and sell cheap that's
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.29,0:12:52.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my motto i'm a businessman you\Nknow that that's selling cheap
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.97,0:12:56.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,parts a lie though don't go\Nslandering my good name brother
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.17,0:13:02.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell has gotten into\Nyou? You're supposed to be a solo
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.61,0:13:08.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Player man, what are you doing\Nhanging around with Asuna? His
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.51,0:13:13.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,HP dropped a zero in a safe\Nzone you sure it wasn't a duel
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.83,0:13:18.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,well no one saw a winner icon\Nwe can also rule out the murder
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.29,0:13:21.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,being asleep PK he was walking\Nwith Yoriko before it happened
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.01,0:13:25.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and besides his death was too\Nelaborate to be some random duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.69,0:13:28.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The PKer who did this had it planned out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.17,0:13:29.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're pretty sure of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.63,0:13:31.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then there's this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.23,0:13:47.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A player made this. Really? Who\Nwas it? Can you tell? Grimlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.11,0:13:48.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never heard that name before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.93,0:13:51.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not one of the top\Nblacksmiths, that's for damn sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.81,0:13:54.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Far as I can tell, there's\Nnothing Special about this,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.45,0:13:56.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yeah, but it's something to go on, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.65,0:13:57.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,MM—Hmm, is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.05,0:14:01.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like an item name listed,\Nyou'll love it: guilty thorn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.59,0:14:03.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a name for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.67,0:14:05.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It kind of fits, though—don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.51,0:14:08.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously, guilty thorn!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.83,0:14:10.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,guilty thorn
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.01,0:14:20.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.99,0:14:24.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.45,0:14:29.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.57,0:14:31.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.19,0:14:32.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you out of your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.91,0:14:34.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That thing's already killed one person!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.89,0:14:38.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, but we need to find out what\Nthis thing's capable of, don't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.57,0:14:40.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you stop being so reckless?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.61,0:14:44.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agil, would you please\Nhold on to this for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.47,0:14:45.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:48.34,0:14:50.84,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(525,476)\fsp-3\fscx95\fscy85\xshad1.5\yshad3\pos(961.5,945)\c&H121212&\4c&H191919&\blur3\fs72\alpha&H40\3c&H05090B&}The Next Day
Dialogue: 1,0:14:48.34,0:14:50.84,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(525,476)\fsp-3\fscx95\fscy85\xshad1.5\yshad3\pos(961.5,945)\c&H121212&\4c&H191919&\blur3\fs72\alpha&H30\3c&H05090B&}The Next Day
Dialogue: 2,0:14:48.34,0:14:50.84,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(525,476)\fscx95\fscy85\shad0\pos(960,942)\blur0.45\fs72\c&HF5F5F5&\fsp-3}The Next Day
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.03,0:15:02.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, uh, Yoriko, we, uh, we were wondering\Nif you had ever heard the name Grimlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.03,0:15:06.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.85,0:15:11.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, until a few months ago, he\Nwas in the guild with me and Caynz.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.33,0:15:15.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, we took the spear that\Nimpaled Caynz to an appraiser.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.95,0:15:20.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We had him go over it pretty carefully,\Nand we found out Grimlock made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.87,0:15:24.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you think of any reason why you did?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.07,0:15:28.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.11,0:15:32.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have told you\Neverything yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.57,0:15:34.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just, I couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.01,0:15:38.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's something I've been\Ntrying very hard to forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.25,0:15:41.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now, I have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.17,0:15:46.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should tell you about\Nhow my guild was destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.99,0:15:54.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we formed it, Golden\NApple was the name we chose.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.97,0:15:59.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Six months ago, we killed a rare monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.53,0:16:03.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It dropped a powerful ring that\Nraised a player's agility by 20.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.01,0:16:07.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some of us wanted to\Nkeep it for the guild,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.31,0:16:10.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,others wanted to sell it\Nand split the earnings.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.97,0:16:14.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We couldn't agree and in the\Nend, we put it to a vote.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.19,0:16:18.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was five to three\Nin favor of selling it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.63,0:16:23.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our leader, Griselda, took it to\Na large town on the front lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.07,0:16:27.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was going to sell it to a\Nbroker and was staying overnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.61,0:16:32.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We waited and waited,\Nbut she never came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.93,0:16:37.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't till later.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.51,0:16:39.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We learned our worst fears had come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.05,0:16:41.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Griselda was dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.69,0:16:45.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To this day, I still\Ndon't know how she died.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.93,0:16:49.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one's gonna leave a safe\Nzone with a rare item like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.37,0:16:50.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too risky.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.79,0:16:53.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think someone could've\Npulled a sleep PK on her?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.45,0:16:55.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not if it was six months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.35,0:16:57.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That method's still sort of new.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.43,0:16:58.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.34,0:17:00.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But she wasn't a random victim either.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.73,0:17:02.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, the killer was after the ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.77,0:17:05.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has to be someone who knew she had it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.61,0:17:06.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.81,0:17:09.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The killer is one of the\Nseven others in our guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.29,0:17:11.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.91,0:17:13.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have our suspects.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.61,0:17:16.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we just have to figure out\Nwho didn't want to sell the ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.61,0:17:19.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I doubt the killer waited till\Nafter Griselda sold the ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.79,0:17:21.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was killed before she sold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.71,0:17:22.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's my guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.79,0:17:23.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.25,0:17:26.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell us what you know about Grimlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.37,0:17:29.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess for starters,\Nhe was Griselda's husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.71,0:17:31.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, but not in real life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.55,0:17:32.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.81,0:17:35.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Griselda was a powerful Swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.39,0:17:38.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was beautiful and smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.17,0:17:44.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grimlock was kind, and I can't\Nremember a day when he wasn't smiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.61,0:17:48.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They made a great couple and\Ngot along as husband and wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.17,0:17:52.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Grimlock is really the one\Nwho murdered Caynz yesterday,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.51,0:17:55.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then he's probably going\Nafter the three guild
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.67,0:17:58.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,members who voted\Nagainst selling the ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.97,0:18:03.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caynz was one of the three who wanted\Nto keep their reign for the guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.69,0:18:04.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was the other one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.79,0:18:07.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then who's the third person?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.53,0:18:09.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The other's a tank named Schmidt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.59,0:18:14.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he, the last I heard, is on the front\Nlines now with the Holy Dragon Alliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.81,0:18:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Schmidt, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.97,0:18:17.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard that name before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.71,0:18:20.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's leader of the defense unit\Nof the Holy Dragon Alliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.03,0:18:22.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's an exceptional lancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.71,0:18:25.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.77,0:18:27.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, do you really know Schmidt?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.83,0:18:31.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I've run into him a couple\Ntimes while clearing bosses, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.35,0:18:32.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to see him right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.81,0:18:34.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you please take me to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.33,0:18:37.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he's on the front lines, he\Nprobably hasn't heard about the murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.73,0:18:41.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He needs to know before what\Nhappened to Caynz happens to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.43,0:18:46.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll help you get in touch with Schmidt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.59,0:18:48.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know someone in the\NHoly Dragon Alliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.01,0:18:50.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll help us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.23,0:18:51.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll visit their HQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.85,0:18:55.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, but first we should make\Nsure she gets back to the inn.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.73,0:18:57.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yolko, you have to stay there, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.35,0:19:01.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously, don't go\Nanywhere until we get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.09,0:19:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.07,0:19:12.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, so how do you think a murder\Nlike this happened in a safe zone?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.17,0:19:14.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can see three ways it could have.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.41,0:19:17.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right off the bat, it's\Npossible it was a fair duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.75,0:19:20.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or maybe someone took\Nadvantage of a bug that
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.77,0:19:22.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,combines a bunch of\Ndifferent kill methods.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.77,0:19:24.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I can see that happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.91,0:19:25.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the third?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.67,0:19:29.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Use something to bypass the\Nprotection of a safe zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.97,0:19:32.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some kind of skill or maybe an item.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.57,0:19:35.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, on second thought, that\Nthird idea is impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.07,0:19:37.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.31,0:19:38.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because it's unfair.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.79,0:19:41.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I kind of hate to admit it, but it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.39,0:19:45.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rules of SAO are essentially\Nfair for every player in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.49,0:19:49.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So there's no way the game would\Nallow murders in safe zones.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.11,0:19:52.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.47,0:20:01.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's what killed Caynz,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.35,0:20:04.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you're sure about the\Nspear, was it really Grimlock's?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.01,0:20:07.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.01,0:20:10.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then why would he wait\Nsix months to kill him?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.53,0:20:13.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless, wait, could he\Nhave stolen the ring?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.71,0:20:17.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think it's possible\Nhe killed Griselda after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.57,0:20:19.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does Grimlock want to kill the three of us
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.75,0:20:22.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because we didn't want\Nto sell the damn ring?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.09,0:20:24.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that why he's after you and me now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.21,0:20:27.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe Grimlock made the spear\Nfor someone else from our guild,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.65,0:20:30.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and maybe they're the\Nones who killed Caynz.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.23,0:20:31.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.67,0:20:34.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Griselda's come back from\Nthe dead to get her revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.17,0:20:38.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A player can't kill another\Nplayer inside a safe zone,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.39,0:20:40.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but something else like a ghost could.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.79,0:20:47.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't sleep at all last\Nnight, so I stayed up thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.03,0:20:50.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was everyone's fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.65,0:20:52.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone in the guild is guilty!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.45,0:20:54.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her blood is on all our hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.85,0:20:57.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our fate was sealed\Nwhen that ring dropped!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.29,0:20:58.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We shouldn't have voted!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.39,0:21:01.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should have done whatever\NGriselda told us to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.59,0:21:09.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grimlock was the only one,\Nthe only member of the guild,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.37,0:21:12.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who said we should leave\Nthe decision to Griselda.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.31,0:21:14.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.47,0:21:17.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the only one of us\Nwho can avenge Griselda.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.13,0:21:21.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the only member of our guild\Nwho has the right to avenge her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.51,0:21:23.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta be kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.83,0:21:25.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta be kidding. Why now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.95,0:21:28.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all this time, why kill us now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.71,0:21:31.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't be okay with this, Yurko!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.95,0:21:35.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you accept being killed\Nover some stupid vendetta?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.81,0:21:56.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.99,0:21:58.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.05,0:22:06.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,go!
